611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":244,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb3b-db0e-11ef-9847-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":247,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb3c-db0e-11ef-b687-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","start_index":251,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb3d-db0e-11ef-a842-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳水","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛水","start_index":260,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb3e-db0e-11ef-a487-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白","place_name_jianti_auto":"白","start_index":264,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb3f-db0e-11ef-9d97-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沸泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"沸泉","start_index":268,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb40-db0e-11ef-8d73-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳山","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛山","start_index":273,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb41-db0e-11ef-af14-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","place_note":"山西臨汾","start_index":305,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb42-db0e-11ef-ba7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"三齐","start_index":317,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb43-db0e-11ef-bd8b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":322,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb44-db0e-11ef-8354-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":332,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb45-db0e-11ef-b9b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":340,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb46-db0e-11ef-b482-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":358,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb47-db0e-11ef-9b8b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"跗，音夫，足趾也。班志：汾水出汾陽北山。汾陽縣屬太原郡，安邑縣屬河東郡。史記正義曰：安邑故城在絳州夏縣東北十五里。應劭曰：絳水出河東絳縣西南。平陽縣亦屬河東郡。安邑，魏絳始居邑。平陽，韓武子玄孫貞子始居之。桓、康二子之肘足接，蓋各爲都邑慮也。水經註曰：絳水出絳縣西南，蓋以故絳爲言，其水出絳山東，西北流而合于澮，猶在絳縣界中。智伯所謂「汾水可以灌安邑」，或亦有之；「絳水可以灌平陽」，未識所由。余謂自春秋之季至于元魏，歷年滋多，郡縣之離合，川谷之遷改，有不可以一時所睹爲據者。史記正義曰：韓初都平陽，今晉州也。括地志曰：絳水一名白，今名沸泉，源出絳山，飛泉奮湧，揚波注縣，積壑三十餘丈，望之極爲奇觀，可接引北灌平陽城。酈道元父範，歷仕三齊，少長齊地，熟其山川，後入關死於道，未嘗至河東也。此蓋因耳學而致疑。括地志成於唐之魏王泰，泰者，太宗之愛子，羅致天下一時名儒以作此書，其考據宜詳，當取以爲據。","note_content_jianti_auto":"跗，音夫，足趾也。班志：汾水出汾阳北山。汾阳县属太原郡，安邑县属河东郡。史记正义曰：安邑故城在绛州夏县东北十五里。应劭曰：绛水出河东绛县西南。平阳县亦属河东郡。安邑，魏绛始居邑。平阳，韩武子玄孙贞子始居之。桓、康二子之肘足接，盖各为都邑虑也。水经注曰：绛水出绛县西南，盖以故绛为言，其水出绛山东，西北流而合于浍，犹在绛县界中。智伯所谓「汾水可以灌安邑」，或亦有之；「绛水可以灌平阳」，未识所由。余谓自春秋之季至于元魏，历年滋多，郡县之离合，川谷之迁改，有不可以一时所睹为据者。史记正义曰：韩初都平阳，今晋州也。括地志曰：绛水一名白，今名沸泉，源出绛山，飞泉奋涌，扬波注县，积壑三十余丈，望之极为奇观，可接引北灌平阳城。郦道元父范，历仕三齐，少长齐地，熟其山川，后入关死于道，未尝至河东也。此盖因耳学而致疑。括地志成于唐之魏王泰，泰者，太宗之爱子，罗致天下一时名儒以作此书，其考据宜详，当取以为据。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb10-db0e-11ef-8e55-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb50-db0e-11ef-b39a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"絺姓","people_name_jianti_auto":"𫄨姓","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb51-db0e-11ef-ac1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇忿生","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏忿生","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb52-db0e-11ef-9384-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"疵","people_name_jianti_auto":"疵","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb53-db0e-11ef-b875-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb54-db0e-11ef-a9fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絺","place_name_jianti_auto":"𫄨","place_note":"河南沁陽市西南","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb55-db0e-11ef-a26e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb56-db0e-11ef-b587-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夫，音扶；餘並同。難，乃旦翻。降，戶江翻，下也，服也。說，輸芮翻。懈，居隘翻，怠也。危難，如字。悛，丑緣翻，改也，止也。絺，抽遲翻，姓也。康曰：「絺」當作「郗」，姓譜諸書未有從絲者，疑借字。余按姓譜：絺姓，周蘇忿生支子，封於絺，因氏焉。爲趙之爲，音于僞翻。使，疏吏翻。疵請出使以避禍也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夫，音扶；余并同。难，乃旦翻。降，户江翻，下也，服也。说，输芮翻。懈，居隘翻，怠也。危难，如字。悛，丑缘翻，改也，止也。𫄨，抽迟翻，姓也。康曰：「𫄨」当作「郗」，姓谱诸书未有从丝者，疑借字。余按姓谱：𫄨姓，周苏忿生支子，封于𫄨，因氏焉。为赵之为，音于伪翻。使，疏吏翻。疵请出使以避祸也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":342,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb4f-db0e-11ef-ab7a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-446,"link_td_description":"魏桓子，又称魏宣子，姬姓，魏氏，名驹，是中国春秋时期晋国大夫，魏氏世族的领袖，魏襄子魏侈之子。曾与韩康子、赵襄子合灭了担任执政的中军将智伯瑶，是为三家灭智。","link_td_id":"Q10001809","link_td_number_id":459836,"people_name":"魏桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏桓子","people_xingming":"魏驹","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8bef655e-db0e-11ef-b1be-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[魏驹]"},{"link_death_year":-446,"link_td_description":"魏桓子，又称魏宣子，姬姓，魏氏，名驹，是中国春秋时期晋国大夫，魏氏世族的领袖，魏襄子魏侈之子。曾与韩康子、赵襄子合灭了担任执政的中军将智伯瑶，是为三家灭智。","link_td_id":"Q10001809","link_td_number_id":459836,"people_name":"桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓子","people_xingming":"魏驹","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8bef6561-db0e-11ef-859a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[魏驹]"},{"link_death_year":-446,"link_td_description":"魏桓子，又称魏宣子，姬姓，魏氏，名驹，是中国春秋时期晋国大夫，魏氏世族的领袖，魏襄子魏侈之子。曾与韩康子、赵襄子合灭了担任执政的中军将智伯瑶，是为三家灭智。","link_td_id":"Q10001809","link_td_number_id":459836,"people_name":"桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓子","people_xingming":"魏驹","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8bef6564-db0e-11ef-ab22-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[魏驹]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"wā","source_anchor_text":"版沈竈產鼃民無叛意","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":20,"text":"鼃","tongjian_id":"699bfa71-c25f-5496-ab2b-a4b019c3193a"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"chī","source_anchor_text":"灌平陽也絺疵謂智伯","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":93,"text":"絺","tongjian_id":"33f61aab-68f9-5f24-a0ad-150629544f2a"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"quān","source_anchor_text":"也智伯不悛絺疵請使","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":333,"text":"悛","tongjian_id":"32842393-5319-52f8-8bce-bd3bf91caafa"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦昭襄王四十八年，司马耿北定太原。庄襄王二年，使蒙骜攻赵...","context_before":"...传》：定十三年，赵鞅入于晋阳以叛，其后简子使尹铎为晋阳，","source_end_index":334,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"02f1ca4e-71d1-5803-94e9-8670f591db2d","source_start_index":296,"source_text":"及知伯攻赵，襄子走晋阳，知伯与韩、魏围而灌之，沉灶产蛙，民无叛意，卒灭知伯。"},{"context_after":"《春秋后语》谓决晋水也。高齐于此置大明宫，因名大明城，其...","context_before":"...安于所筑。城东有汾水，南流与城西之晋水汇，故《史记》曰：","source_end_index":526,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"02f1ca4e-71d1-5803-94e9-8670f591db2d","source_start_index":517,"source_text":"智伯引汾水以灌城。"},{"context_after":"其渎乘高东北注入晋阳城，周围灌溉，东南出城，流注于汾。其...","context_before":"晋水[在城西南。源出悬瓮山。《水经注》：","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"057302b6-174e-56ad-945c-9e2913c6e7ba","source_start_index":20,"source_text":"昔知伯遏晋水以灌之晋阳，因分为二流，北渎即知氏故渠也。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"旧《史》云：汾水可以灌安邑，绛水可以灌平阳，乃文误耳。后...","context_before":"...州府南流，历灵石、赵城、洪洞等县流经此，又南入襄陵县界。","source_end_index":114,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"23fb985b-f1d9-5bb4-a93f-cd94cdb8e569","source_start_index":41,"source_text":"周威烈王时，韩康子都平阳，从智伯伐赵，决晋水灌晋阳。智伯曰：吾乃今知水可以亡人国也。魏桓子时韩康子履桓子之跗，以汾水可以灌平阳，绛水可以灌安邑也。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"三家以國人圍而灌之，城不浸者三版；沈竈產鼃，民無叛意。智伯行水，魏桓子御，韓康子驂乘。智伯曰：「吾乃今知水可以亡人國也。」桓子肘康子，康子履桓子之跗，以汾水可以灌安邑，絳水可以灌平陽也。絺疵謂智伯曰：「韓、魏必反矣。」智伯曰：「子何以知之？」絺疵曰：「以人事知之。夫從韓、魏之兵以攻趙，趙亡，難必及韓、魏矣。今約勝趙而三分其地，城不沒者三版，人馬相食，城降有日，而二子無喜志，有憂色，是非反而何？」明日，智伯以絺疵之言告二子，二子曰：「此夫讒人欲爲趙氏游說，使主疑於二家而懈於攻趙氏也。不然，夫二家豈不利朝夕分趙氏之田，而欲爲危難不可成之事乎！」二子出，絺疵入曰：「主何以臣之言告二子也？」智伯曰：「子何以知之？」對曰：「臣見其視臣端而趨疾，知臣得其情故也。」智伯不悛。絺疵請使於齊。","content_fanyi":"智瑶、韩康子、魏桓子三家统领国人包围晋阳，并引水灌城，城墙没有被水淹没的部分只有三版高；锅灶沉没在水中，生出了蛙蛤，百姓仍没有背叛之意。智瑶巡视水势，魏桓子为之驾车，韩康子在右边陪乘。智瑶说：“我如今才知道，水可以灭亡他人的国家啊。”魏桓子用胳膊肘碰了碰韩康子，韩康子又踩了踩魏桓子的脚背，两人都想到汾水可以灌魏都安邑，绛水可以灌韩都平阳。絺疵对智瑶说：“韩、魏两家必定会反叛。”智瑶问：“您凭什么知道？”絺疵说：“根据人事推知。我们率领韩、魏两家的军队攻打赵氏，赵氏灭亡之后，祸难必然落到韩、魏两家。如今约定战胜赵氏后三家瓜分其地，城墙没被水淹没的只有三版，城中人马相食，城池投降只是早晚的事，而这两人没有喜悦之意，反而面有忧色，这不是要反叛又是什么？”次日，智瑶把絺疵的话告诉了韩、魏二人，二人说：“这是那进谗言的人想替赵氏游说，让主公怀疑我们两家而放松攻打赵氏啊。不然的话，我们两家难道不乐于早晚分取赵氏的田地，反而要去做危险而难以成功的事吗？”两人出去后，絺疵进来说：“主公为什么把臣的话告诉那两人呢？”智瑶说：“您怎么知道？”絺疵回答说：“臣看到他们盯着臣看而且快步离开，便知道他们已经察觉臣掌握了实情。”智瑶仍不悔改。絺疵于是请求出使齐国以避祸。","content_jianti_auto":"三家以国人围而灌之，城不浸者三版；沈灶产鼃，民无叛意。智伯行水，魏桓子御，韩康子骖乘。智伯曰：「吾乃今知水可以亡人国也。」桓子肘康子，康子履桓子之跗，以汾水可以灌安邑，绛水可以灌平阳也。𫄨疵谓智伯曰：「韩、魏必反矣。」智伯曰：「子何以知之？」𫄨疵曰：「以人事知之。夫从韩、魏之兵以攻赵，赵亡，难必及韩、魏矣。今约胜赵而三分其地，城不没者三版，人马相食，城降有日，而二子无喜志，有忧色，是非反而何？」明日，智伯以𫄨疵之言告二子，二子曰：「此夫谗人欲为赵氏游说，使主疑于二家而懈于攻赵氏也。不然，夫二家岂不利朝夕分赵氏之田，而欲为危难不可成之事乎！」二子出，𫄨疵入曰：「主何以臣之言告二子也？」智伯曰：「子何以知之？」对曰：「臣见其视臣端而趋疾，知臣得其情故也。」智伯不悛。𫄨疵请使于齐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"前乎智伯者，未之有也，而赵卒不亡，智自亡耳。后乎智伯者，...","context_before":"...者也，幸而自败，不幸而即以自亡。自亡者智伯，败者梁武也。","source_end_index":61,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"86e7f6fe-6609-45f9-a96d-1d13bf3056fa","source_start_index":42,"source_text":"智伯曰：“吾今而知水之可以亡人之国。”"}],"title":"一二 水能亡人之国"}],"id":15,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙襄子","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵襄子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8bf40341-db0e-11ef-99f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8bf40342-db0e-11ef-ab0a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"代國","place_name_jianti_auto":"代国","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8bf40343-db0e-11ef-865a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏屋","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏屋","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8bf40344-db0e-11ef-82dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"句注","place_name_jianti_auto":"句注","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8bf40345-db0e-11ef-9c02-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"代郡","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8bf40346-db0e-11ef-a418-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"代縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"代县","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8bf40347-db0e-11ef-a783-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"代國在夏屋句注之北，趙襄子滅之。班志有代郡代縣。爲，于僞翻。夏，戶雅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"代国在夏屋句注之北，赵襄子灭之。班志有代郡代县。为，于伪翻。夏，户雅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8bf40340-db0e-11ef-a28b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"成，諡也。諡法：安民立政曰成。","note_content_jianti_auto":"成，谥也。谥法：安民立政曰成。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8bf40349-db0e-11ef-a489-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"威烈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威烈王","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8bf4034d-db0e-11ef-8412-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄子","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄子","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8bf4034e-db0e-11ef-8e1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵桓子","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8bf4034f-db0e-11ef-aa4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"献侯","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8bf40350-db0e-11ef-a85d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"浣","people_name_jianti_auto":"浣","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8bf40351-db0e-11ef-b5ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記·六國表，威烈王元年，襄子卒；二年，趙桓子元年，卒；明年，國人立獻侯浣。「浣」，索隱作「晚」。卒，子恤翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记·六国表，威烈王元年，襄子卒；二年，赵桓子元年，卒；明年，国人立献侯浣。「浣」，索隐作「晚」。卒，子恤翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8bf4034c-db0e-11ef-8074-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"獻子","people_name_jianti_auto":"献子","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8bf40355-db0e-11ef-b8bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"献侯","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8bf40356-db0e-11ef-ab47-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"威烈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威烈王","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8bf40357-db0e-11ef-bdd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"献侯","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8bf40358-db0e-11ef-856b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8bf40359-db0e-11ef-bc42-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"三晋","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8bf4035a-db0e-11ef-b11f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻；又音如字。獻子，卽獻侯。六國表：威烈王三年，獻侯之元年。蓋分晉之後，三晉僭侯久矣。諡法：知質有聖曰獻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻；又音如字。献子，即献侯。六国表：威烈王三年，献侯之元年。盖分晋之后，三晋僭侯久矣。谥法：知质有圣曰献。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"8bf40354-db0e-11ef-a692-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：有功安民曰烈；秉德尊業曰烈。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：有功安民曰烈；秉德尊业曰烈。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8bf4035d-db0e-11ef-bf58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：學勤好問曰文；慈惠安民曰文。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：学勤好问曰文；慈惠安民曰文。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a8d-db0e-11ef-a696-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"威烈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威烈王","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a90-db0e-11ef-9518-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏文侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏文侯","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a91-db0e-11ef-bdbe-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓景侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩景侯","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a92-db0e-11ef-a211-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"威烈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威烈王","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a93-db0e-11ef-83bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a94-db0e-11ef-99ee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：克定禍亂曰武；布義行剛曰景。六國表：威烈王二年，魏文侯斯元年；十八年，韓景侯虔元年。蓋其在國僭爵已久，不敢以通王室；威烈王遂因而命之，識者重爲周惜。通鑑於此序三家之世也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：克定祸乱曰武；布义行刚曰景。六国表：威烈王二年，魏文侯斯元年；十八年，韩景侯虔元年。盖其在国僭爵已久，不敢以通王室；威烈王遂因而命之，识者重为周惜。通鉴于此序三家之世也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"8bf42a8f-db0e-11ef-bb46-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-446,"link_td_description":"魏桓子，又称魏宣子，姬姓，魏氏，名驹，是中国春秋时期晋国大夫，魏氏世族的领袖，魏襄子魏侈之子。曾与韩康子、赵襄子合灭了担任执政的中军将智伯瑶，是为三家灭智。","link_td_id":"Q10001809","link_td_number_id":459836,"people_name":"魏桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏桓子","people_xingming":"魏桓子","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"8bf42aab-db0e-11ef-a7a4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"襄子爲伯魯之不立也，有子五人，不肯置後。封伯魯之子於代，曰代成君，早卒；立其子浣爲趙氏後。襄子卒，弟桓子逐浣而自立；一年卒。趙氏之人曰：「桓子立非襄主意。」乃共殺其子，復迎浣而立之，是爲獻子。獻子生籍，是爲烈侯。魏斯者，魏桓子之孫也，是爲文侯。韓康子生武子；武子生虔，是爲景侯。","content_fanyi":"赵襄子因为哥哥伯鲁当年未能被父亲立为继承人，自己虽有五个儿子，却不肯立他们为继承人。他把伯鲁的儿子封在代地，号称代成君；代成君早死，又立代成君的儿子赵浣为赵氏继承人。赵襄子去世后，他的弟弟赵桓子（《史记》记载赵桓子是赵襄子的同母弟，《世本》记载赵桓子是赵襄子之子，目前大多同意后者）驱逐了赵浣，自立为赵氏主君；在位一年就死了。赵氏族人说：“桓子自立，并不是赵襄子主君的本意。”于是族人共同杀了桓子的儿子，又迎回赵浣立为赵氏之主，这就是赵献子。赵献子生赵籍，就是赵烈侯。魏斯，是魏桓子的孙子，就是魏文侯。韩康子生韩武子；韩武子生韩虔，就是韩景侯。","content_jianti_auto":"襄子为伯鲁之不立也，有子五人，不肯置后。封伯鲁之子于代，曰代成君，早卒；立其子浣为赵氏后。襄子卒，弟桓子逐浣而自立；一年卒。赵氏之人曰：「桓子立非襄主意。」乃共杀其子，复迎浣而立之，是为献子。献子生籍，是为烈侯。魏斯者，魏桓子之孙也，是为文侯。韩康子生武子；武子生虔，是为景侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8bf4033f-db0e-11ef-a48f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8bf4033f-db0e-11ef-a48f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"profile":{"alias_list":["魏桓子","魏宣子"],"biography":"魏桓子，又称魏宣子，姬姓，魏氏，名驹，是中国春秋时期晋国大夫，魏氏世族的领袖，魏襄子魏侈之子。曾与韩康子、赵襄子合灭了担任执政的中军将智伯瑶，是为三家灭智。","death_year":-446,"link_td_id":"Q10001809","name":"魏驹","number_id":459836},"relationships":[{"direction":"forward","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"来源文本：魏襄子魏侈之子","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的父是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100023","relation_property_label":"父","source_person_id":"Q10001809","source_person_name":"魏驹","source_person_number_id":459836,"statement_id":"S-Q10001809-P100023-Q10001808","target_person_id":"Q10001808","target_person_name":"魏曼多","target_person_number_id":521654},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"来源文本：魏驹之子","relation_property_display_template":"{subject}的父是{value}","relation_property_id":"P100023","relation_property_label":"父","source_person_id":"Q10002987","source_person_name":"魏成","source_person_number_id":1522959,"statement_id":"S-Q10002987-P100023-Q10001809","target_person_id":"Q10001809","target_person_name":"魏驹","targ